      "widgets_values": [
        "# Keyframe production canvas\n\nManual ComfyUI default:\n- 69.switch defaults to true, so node 12 main reference affects the image immediately.\n- 68/67/66 default to false; enable them only when Character A / Character B / style references are intentionally loaded.\n- Default prompt is a single keyframe prompt, not a character sheet or turnaround prompt.\n\nRunningHub/API mode:\n- nodeInfo still controls all switches through {{has_reference_image}} and {{has_reference_image_1..3}}.\n\nManual img2img note: KSampler denoise defaults to 0.38 so the reference image is preserved. Raise only when you intentionally want stronger redraw.\n"
